  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Ivan Čermak is a Croatian entrepreneur and retired general who built substantial wealth in the petroleum business. Born in Zagreb, he developed the Tifon and Crodux fuel businesses, selling Tifon to Hungary’s MOL and later Crodux’s petrol-station network to Slovenia’s Petrol. He subsequently established Delta-Oil International as a platform for wholesale petroleum trading.",
    "html": "<p>Ivan Čermak is a Croatian entrepreneur and retired general who built substantial wealth in the petroleum business. Born in Zagreb, he developed the Tifon and Crodux fuel businesses, selling Tifon to Hungary’s MOL and later Crodux’s petrol-station network to Slovenia’s Petrol. He subsequently established Delta-Oil International as a platform for wholesale petroleum trading.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 53,
