  "long_biography": {
    "plain_text": "For Ivan Čermak, the port of Gaženica became an important base for fuel storage and distribution. He retained the terminal there while moving most of his business activities into Delta-Oil International, which he founded in 2021. The company continued wholesaling petroleum products and arranged storage capacity with the Adriatic pipeline operator JANAF.\n\nThe wider Delta group combines trading with physical infrastructure. Its Zadar terminals handle petroleum products and biofuels, alongside vegetable oils and grain. Separate facilities store heated palm oil and unheated oils or grains. Čermak’s son Hrvoje has joined the terminal company’s management, with professional executives overseeing operations.",
    "html": "<p>For Ivan Čermak, the port of Gaženica became an important base for fuel storage and distribution. He retained the terminal there while moving most of his business activities into Delta-Oil International, which he founded in 2021. The company continued wholesaling petroleum products and arranged storage capacity with the Adriatic pipeline operator JANAF.</p>\r\n<p>The wider Delta group combines trading with physical infrastructure. Its Zadar terminals handle petroleum products and biofuels, alongside vegetable oils and grain. Separate facilities store heated palm oil and unheated oils or grains. Čermak’s son Hrvoje has joined the terminal company’s management, with professional executives overseeing operations.</p>\r\n",
